== Overview ==
'''Spider Toilet''' is a big toilet and is the third weakest toilet in the game. It’s toilet is white, and has spider legs which is why it’s called the spider toilet. Spider Toilets are a bit tougher than the regular toilet, as they're standard issue ground troops. It has a stronger version with a lot more HP and stunning power, the [[Turret Spider Toilet]]. This is a bad design, it looks nothing like the series.  
