== Strategy ==
*Most towers should be able to defeat this if you have enough towers. It is slightly faster than the Normal Toilet. These often come in tight groups, so place low cooldown attacking units.
== Trivia ==

* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Strider_Skibidi_Toilet Strider Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* In the series, it has a turret that can be used to attack. It can also attack by using its legs to spear cameramen.
* It also do 40 damage to the base

